    "Had a lovely",
    "quiet Sunday.",
    "I have not",
    "been here for",
    "many years;",
    "then my loved",
    "Father was",
    "with me.",
    "All the family",
    "seem to be looking",
    "very well. It does",
    "me positive good,",
